      *================================================================*
      * PROGRAM  : UTANLYSC                                            *
      * TYPE     : UNIT TEST DRIVER                                    *
      * PURPOSE  : UNIT TESTS FOR ANLYSCAL - ANALYSIS SERVICE CHARGE,  *
      *            EARNINGS CREDIT OFFSET AND PUBLIC FUNDS CARRY-FWD   *
      *================================================================*
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UTANLYSC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY TESTPARM.
       COPY ANLYPARM.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 'INIT' TO TST-FUNCTION
           MOVE 'ANLYSCAL' TO TST-SUITE-NAME
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS

           PERFORM 1000-TEST-PRICING
           PERFORM 2000-TEST-CREDIT-OFFSET
           PERFORM 3000-TEST-CARRY-FORWARD
           PERFORM 4000-TEST-WAIVER

           MOVE 'SUMM' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS
           STOP RUN.

       1000-TEST-PRICING.
           PERFORM 8000-STANDARD-VOLUMES
           CALL 'ANLYSCAL' USING ANALYSIS-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'TOTAL SERVICE CHARGE AT STANDARD PRICES 467.00'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 467.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-TOTAL-SVC-CHARGE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'OUTGOING WIRE PRICE $15.00' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 15.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-SVC-UNIT-PRICE(2) TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'ZBA MAINTENANCE 2 x $35.00' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 70.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-SVC-CHARGE(8) TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           PERFORM 8000-STANDARD-VOLUMES
           MOVE 'Y' TO ANL-MSB-FLAG
           CALL 'ANLYSCAL' USING ANALYSIS-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'MSB ACH ITEM PRICE 150% = $0.15' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 0.15 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-SVC-UNIT-PRICE(1) TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       2000-TEST-CREDIT-OFFSET.
           PERFORM 8000-STANDARD-VOLUMES
           MOVE 300.00 TO ANL-EARNINGS-CREDIT
           CALL 'ANLYSCAL' USING ANALYSIS-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'NET CHARGE = 467.00 - 300.00 ECR' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 167.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-NET-CHARGE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

           PERFORM 8000-STANDARD-VOLUMES
           MOVE 600.00 TO ANL-EARNINGS-CREDIT
           CALL 'ANLYSCAL' USING ANALYSIS-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'CREDIT EXCEEDS CHARGES - NET CHARGE ZERO'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE ZERO TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-NET-CHARGE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'CORPORATE EXCESS CREDIT 133.00 FORFEITED'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 133.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-CREDIT-FORFEITED TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'CORPORATE NOTHING CARRIED FORWARD' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE ZERO TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-CF-OUT(1) TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       3000-TEST-CARRY-FORWARD.
      *    GOVERNMENT: CF 100 / 50 / 80, ECR 300, CHARGES 467
           PERFORM 8000-STANDARD-VOLUMES
           MOVE 'IN'   TO ANL-SEGMENT
           MOVE 300.00 TO ANL-EARNINGS-CREDIT
           MOVE 100.00 TO ANL-CF-IN(1)
           MOVE  50.00 TO ANL-CF-IN(2)
           MOVE  80.00 TO ANL-CF-IN(3)
           CALL 'ANLYSCAL' USING ANALYSIS-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'GOVT - ALL CARRY-FORWARD BUCKETS CONSUMED 230.00'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 230.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-CF-APPLIED TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'GOVT - UNUSED CURRENT CREDIT 63.00 TO BUCKET 1'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 63.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-CF-OUT(1) TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'GOVT - NET CHARGE ZERO' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE ZERO TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-NET-CHARGE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

      *    GOVERNMENT: ONLY SWEEP FEE 100; CF3 80 USED, CF2 20 OF 50
           PERFORM 8100-RESET
           MOVE 'IN'   TO ANL-SEGMENT
           MOVE 1      TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(9)
           MOVE 200.00 TO ANL-EARNINGS-CREDIT
           MOVE  30.00 TO ANL-CF-IN(1)
           MOVE  50.00 TO ANL-CF-IN(2)
           MOVE  80.00 TO ANL-CF-IN(3)
           CALL 'ANLYSCAL' USING ANALYSIS-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'GOVT - OLDEST FIRST: CF2 REMAINDER AGES TO BUCKET 3'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 30.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-CF-OUT(3) TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'GOVT - CF1 UNTOUCHED AGES TO BUCKET 2'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 30.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-CF-OUT(2) TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ
           MOVE 'GOVT - FULL CURRENT CREDIT 200 TO BUCKET 1'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 200.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-CF-OUT(1) TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

      *    GOVERNMENT: 3-MONTH-OLD CREDIT EXPIRES
           PERFORM 8100-RESET
           MOVE 'IN'   TO ANL-SEGMENT
           MOVE 2      TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(6)
           MOVE  80.00 TO ANL-CF-IN(3)
           CALL 'ANLYSCAL' USING ANALYSIS-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'GOVT - UNUSED 3-MONTH CREDIT 30.00 EXPIRES'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 30.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-CF-EXPIRED TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ

      *    NON-GOVERNMENT CARRY-FORWARD INPUT IS IGNORED / FORFEITED
           PERFORM 8100-RESET
           MOVE 'CB'   TO ANL-SEGMENT
           MOVE 2      TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(6)
           MOVE  80.00 TO ANL-CF-IN(1)
           CALL 'ANLYSCAL' USING ANALYSIS-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'CORPORATE - CARRY-FORWARD NOT HONOURED'
             TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 50.00 TO TST-EXP-NUM
           MOVE ANL-NET-CHARGE TO TST-ACT-NUM
           PERFORM 9000-NEQ.

       4000-TEST-WAIVER.
           PERFORM 8100-RESET
           MOVE 5    TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(1)
           MOVE 0.25 TO ANL-EARNINGS-CREDIT
           CALL 'ANLYSCAL' USING ANALYSIS-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'NET CHARGE 0.25 UNDER $1.00 WAIVED' TO TST-CASE-NAME
           MOVE 'N' TO TST-CONDITION
           IF ANL-NET-CHARGE = 0 AND ANL-CHARGE-WAIVED
               MOVE 'Y' TO TST-CONDITION
           END-IF
           PERFORM 9200-TRUE.

       8000-STANDARD-VOLUMES.
           PERFORM 8100-RESET
           MOVE 100 TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(1)
           MOVE 10  TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(2)
           MOVE 5   TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(3)
           MOVE 50  TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(4)
           MOVE 20  TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(5)
           MOVE 3   TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(6)
           MOVE 2   TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(7)
           MOVE 2   TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(8)
           MOVE 1   TO ANL-SVC-VOLUME(9).

       8100-RESET.
           INITIALIZE ANALYSIS-CALC-PARMS
           MOVE 'CB' TO ANL-SEGMENT
           MOVE 'N'  TO ANL-MSB-FLAG.

       9000-NEQ.
           MOVE 'NEQ' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.

       9200-TRUE.
           MOVE 'TRUE' TO TST-FUNCTION
           CALL 'TESTLIB' USING TEST-PARMS.
